//RS //! Invocation-scoped typed owners for Source/Core resource iteration.
//RS //!
//RS //! This is deliberately the only JIT-side table for Source resource leases.  A
//RS //! slot is keyed by an arena-issued raw capability plus the checked MIR handle
//RS //! identity and exact resource kind.  Raw values are opaque capabilities: they
//RS //! are never cast to pointers, passed to a Rust semantic evaluator, or treated
//RS //! as an item value.
//RS 
